  "pull_request": {
    "number": 230,
    "title": "Add editor integration for inline Soroban Cost Linter diagnostics",
    "body": "##close #137 \r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a documented editor integration for the Soroban Cost Linter, enabling inline diagnostics while editing source code by leveraging the existing `cargo cost-lint` CLI.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n### Editor Integration\r\n\r\n- Added a documented editor workflow using `rust-analyzer`'s `check.overrideCommand`.\r\n- Reused the existing `cargo cost-lint` entrypoint and rustc-format diagnostics.\r\n- Verified diagnostics appear inline with correct source spans.\r\n\r\n### Documentation\r\n\r\nAdded:\r\n\r\n- `docs/integration.md`\r\n\r\nThe guide covers:\r\n\r\n- Prerequisites\r\n- Nightly toolchain requirement\r\n- Installation\r\n- VS Code / rust-analyzer configuration\r\n- Example `settings.json`\r\n- Supported editors\r\n- Troubleshooting\r\n- Known limitations\r\n- Recovery steps\r\n\r\n### README\r\n\r\nUpdated the README to accurately describe IDE support and point users to the integration guide.\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\nVerified:\r\n\r\n- ✅ Inline diagnostics appear in the editor.\r\n- ✅ Diagnostic locations match source code.\r\n- ✅ Existing CLI behaviour is preserved.\r\n\r\n### Checks\r\n\r\n- ✅ `cargo fmt --all -- --check`\r\n- ✅ `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings`\r\n- ✅ `cargo test --workspace`\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n\r\nThis implementation provides a low-friction editor integration using existing tooling rather than introducing a bespoke language server. Documentation clearly explains the required nightly toolchain and any remaining limitations.\r\n\r\nCloses #<issue-number>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Editor Verification\r\n\r\nInclude a screenshot or short recording showing inline diagnostics in the configured editor.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Local Test Output\r\n\r\nPaste the full output of:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\ncargo fmt --all -- --check\r\ncargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings\r\ncargo test --workspace\r\n```\r\n\r\nbefore submitting the PR.",
